"""
# Simple2D vs Skia vs Browser TTF Font Rendering Parity Spec

Verifies:
1. Chrome 26.6 fractional `font_size_milli` (13.333px, 18.72px vs 18.715px) and
   quarter-pixel pen splitting (`sfnt_font_cache_key_milli_px`, `sfnt_subpixel_pen_split_milli`).
2. Horizontal kerning pairs (`AV`, `To`, `Mo`, `fl`) across `sfnt_kern`,
   `FontRenderer.horizontal_kern_size_milli`, `SkFont.measure_text_kerned`,
   and Browser TTF `ttf_paint_text_aa_clip_range_adv`.
3. `hmtx.lsb != glyf.xMin` bearing alignment (`meta[19]` contour origin vs
   `meta[3]` `hmtx.lsb` and Skia `sfnt_rasterize_glyph_baseline_aligned`).
4. Synthetic bold advance widening & non-overlapping glyph placement in
   Browser TTF fallback stepping (`ttf_paint_text_aa_clip_range_adv`).
5. Engine2D 5x7 spaced fallback (`6 * scale`, UTF-8 codepoint stepping) vs Skia
   5x7 fallback (`<= 1px` run width parity, `0` horizontal ink overlap).
6. End-to-end run width parity (`<= 1px`) across Skia, `FontRenderer`,
   `Engine2DFontOwner`, `ShapedRun`, and Browser TTF (`ttf_measure_text_px_milli`).
"""
# @req REQ-TEXT-LAYOUT-PARITY-001
# @tag: unit, text_layout, font, skia, engine2d, browser_engine
# @cover src/lib/common/encoding/sfnt_kern.spl 20%
# @cover src/lib/common/encoding/sfnt_glyf.spl 15%
# @cover src/lib/nogc_sync_mut/text_layout/font_renderer.spl 10%
# @cover src/lib/gc_async_mut/gpu/engine2d/glyph.spl 40%
# @cover src/lib/skia/entity/font.spl 25%
# @cover src/lib/skia/feature/glyph/font_metrics.spl 30%
# @cover src/lib/skia/feature/glyph/rasterize.spl 25%
# @cover src/lib/skia/feature/shaper/shaper.spl 15%
# @cover src/lib/gc_async_mut/gpu/browser_engine/simple_web_html_layout_renderer_paint_gradients_text.spl 20%

